[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.95) {Ben};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40,2.10,2.80,3.50,4.20} {\draw[fill=blue!15] (\x,0.65) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.30) {Ali};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40,2.10} {\draw[fill=red!12] (\x,0.00) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[right,font=\small] at (5.05,0.30) {$?$};
\draw[dashed] (2.80,1.30)--(2.80,-0.15);
\draw[<->] (2.80,-0.30)--(4.90,-0.30);
\node[below,font=\small] at (3.85,-0.30) {$18$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Ben and Ali share some stickers in the ratio $7:4$.
Ben gets $18$ more stickers than Ali.
How many stickers does Ali get?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.95) {Nina};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70} {\draw[fill=blue!15] (\x,0.65) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\node[left,font=\small] at (-0.1,0.30) {Omar};
\foreach \x in {0.00,0.70,1.40,2.10,2.80} {\draw[fill=red!12] (\x,0.00) rectangle +(0.7,0.6);}
\draw[decorate,decoration={brace,amplitude=5pt}] (3.75,1.25)--(3.75,0) node[midway,right=8pt,font=\small] {$?$};
\draw[dashed] (1.40,1.30)--(1.40,-0.15);
\draw[<->] (1.40,-0.30)--(3.50,-0.30);
\node[below,font=\small] at (2.45,-0.30) {$\$48$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Nina and Omar share some money in the ratio $2:5$.
Nina gets $\$48$ less than Omar.
How much money is shared altogether?
